odroid-homecloud (0.4.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Display rotating CPU, RAM, storage and network statistics on the HC4 OLED.
  * Build an architecture-independent Python 3 package using debhelper 13
    and the pyproject backend, without pip calls during installation.
  * Declare runtime dependencies through APT and retain upstream licensing.
  * Document remote builds, WSL, SCP and SFTP installation.
  * Generate Debian package artifacts with GitHub Actions.

